    skos:altLabel "APC"@en ;
    skos:definition "Cell, such as a dendritic cell or macrophage, that is responsible for making antigens accessible to lymphocytes and other immune effector and regulatory cells, making possible specific recognition by receptors on the cell surface."@en ;
